# The comments describe the run on a node (DESIGN.md §10, "On a node"). On a node, account 0
# deploys, so it holds the initial supply and is the minter.
init 1000
BalanceOf account0
Transfer account1 300
Transfer account2 100 from=1
Transfer account2 201 from=1    # balance too low
Transfer account0 100 from=2
Transfer account1 0 from=3
Transfer account3 1 from=3      # balance too low
Transfer account1 50 from=1     # to itself
BalanceOf account0
BalanceOf account1
BalanceOf account2
Mint account2 50
Mint account2 50 from=1         # not the minter
Mint account0 MAX               # overflow
Transfer account0 5 from=1
TotalSupply
BalanceOf account2
